                    <!-- ── iPlan: scenario trajectories (ADDED 2026-10-10, step 1) ─────────
                         Users draw their own "scenario" wellbores with the same section
                         types/math as QuickPlan (/js/iplanCore.js), starting from a planned
                         well's surface (editable) or tied on at an MD of a planned well.
                         Drawn in green in this 3D view, recalculated live. NOT part of the
                         score cards or the Trajectories accordion. Step 1 = in-browser only
                         (scenarios are lost on reload); saving per job = later step. -->
                    <style>
                        .ipl-root{ border:1px solid var(--wbt-border); border-radius:4px; margin-bottom:10px; background:var(--wbt-panel); }
                        .ipl-head{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:8px 10px; cursor:pointer; user-select:none; }
