                                <div id="wsTree"></div>
                                <div class="ws-dim" style="font-size:11px;margin-top:6px;">Index over the job's data: surveys (WellboreTrajectory), T&amp;D plan runs and BHAs, Hydraulics, Casing Design, Slide Sheets, SAG / Pipe Stretch cases. Nothing is copied or moved; deleting or rebuilding the structure never deletes data. Each uploaded subject trajectory is a Plan or an Actual (set at upload, or here); a wellbore can hold plans (versions, the highest = current), the actual survey and its corrections (MWD+PS+SAG+MSA+SCC+SSA). Build rules: surveys already assigned stay where they are; well = “[NN]” prefix, incl. [01I] / [01P] (same as the Legs Summary); surveys without a prefix join the well sharing a 6+ digit number (UWI / licence); engineering survey = the Actual, else the highest plan version, wellbore = _L&lt;NN&gt; suffix (L01 = main bore); runs = active runs of the T&amp;D plan (active scenario first). Each Run owns its BHA: saving a run writes it into the linked T&amp;D plan run, and saving in T&amp;D updates the run here.</div>
                            </div>
